sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Person as Person
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Person: assignRole(role)
    Note over Person: Policies: personRead, personWrite, personExecute
    Note over Person: Guards (3)
    Person->>Person: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;active#quot;
    Person->>Person: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Person->>Person: guard[2]: roleAllows(user.role, #quot;adminAccess#quot;)
    Person->>Person: mutate.role
    Person->>EventBus: emit PersonRoleAssigned on person.role_assigned
    Person-->>-Client: void